"meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":105,"timestampLabel":"1:45","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- don't think that'll be a problem.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1051-155","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1051,"timestampLabel":"17:31","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- or protect the well-being of my staff and myself. When I sought help, I often felt unheard","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1058-156","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1058,"timestampLabel":"17:38","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- At times, I felt dismissed, ridiculed, and made to feel as if my concerns and my professional judgment","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1065-157","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1065,"timestampLabel":"17:45","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- did not matter. I raised these concerns through the appropriate channels, hoping for meaningful support","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1073-158","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1073,"timestampLabel":"17:53","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- and solutions. But instead, the situation only got worse. As a special education teacher, I've always","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-108-14","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":108,"timestampLabel":"1:48","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- just for procedure. I figured I'd give it a say. So I don't know. Do we have a list? Okay. Well, then,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1081-159","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1081,"timestampLabel":"18:01","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- understood that the work is challenging. I have never expected it to be easy.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1088-160","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1088,"timestampLabel":"18:08","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- But what became unbearable was being expected to manage severe student behaviors, repeated physical","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1095-161","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1095,"timestampLabel":"18:15","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- aggression, and unsafe working conditions without adequate support. My staff and I were injured regularly.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1103-162","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1103,"timestampLabel":"18:23","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I personally underwent three surgeries related to injuries sustained at work. Despite repeated pleas","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1110-163","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1110,"timestampLabel":"18:30","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- for help and advocacy for my students, my staff, and myself, I was too often met with the message","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1117-164","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1117,"timestampLabel":"18:37","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- that it was simply part of my job. It is not. No educator should feel unsafe at work. No teacher should","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1124-165","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1124,"timestampLabel":"18:44","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- have to fund essential classroom needs out of pocket because they are told to buy it themselves. No","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1131-166","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1131,"timestampLabel":"18:51","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- staff member should feel that their voice concerns or wellbeing are irrelevant. Over time, the emotional,","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1138-167","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1138,"timestampLabel":"18:58","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- physical, and mental toll became too great. I began dreading a job I once loved deeply.","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1145-168","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1145,"timestampLabel":"19:05","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- I lost talented members because they, too, could no longer endure the physical and emotional demands","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1153-169","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1153,"timestampLabel":"19:13","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- without proper support. Perhaps hardest of all was realizing that the passion and joy I once brought","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-116-15","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":116,"timestampLabel":"1:56","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- uh, Mrs. Barrett will go down the list and call you up to the podium. And if you would please state","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1162-170","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School 