 Board 4/21/2026","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","timestampSeconds":1720,"timestampLabel":"28:40","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- psychologists is what they're trying to backfill that. So they're providing the funding for it. It takes","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15761-tx-1727-223","meetingDate":"2026-04-21","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 4/21/2026","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","timestampSeconds":1727,"timestampLabel":"28:47","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- them out of our education fund","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15761-tx-1729-224","meetingDate":"2026-04-21","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 4/21/2026","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","timestampSeconds":1729,"timestampLabel":"28:49","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- Correct. Including the benefits and everything. Teachers stay on the pay schedule. Okay. They stay on","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15761-tx-1736-225","meetingDate":"2026-04-21","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 4/21/2026","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15761","timestampSeconds":1736,"timestampLabel":"28:56","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- turf. Okay. And then in four years, like you said, we may not need four people. We defini